### 8. Recommended Title Options

1. **"You Bought the Report. That's Not an AI Strategy."** — Ranked first. Direct, confrontational, immediately recognizable to the target reader. Names the villain in the title and signals the article has something better. Works on LinkedIn and in search.

2. **"The Consultant That Wins Is the One That Leaves Fastest"** — Ranked second. Highly distinctive and counterintuitive. Strong LinkedIn shareability. Undersells the broader article content; works better as a section header than a primary title.

3. **"What Enterprise AI Actually Looks Like When It Works"** — Ranked third. Safer, broader appeal, stronger for organic search. Less provocative. Works well as a subtitle if the primary title leads with the first option.

